{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dadlympics",
    "steam_appid": 1096760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096760/extras/66015113efdf05c3688adb2cc0f167d2.avif?t=1732038348\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of dynamic physics-based entertainment with DADLYMPICS! Unleash laughter as you take on side-splitting dad-worthy challenges alongside friends. Who will emerge as the ultimate dad? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096760/extras/5c3f60e121abb1ee25ce5ce694a2ae37.avif?t=1732038348\" /></div>Engage in hilarious competitions, conquer quirky tasks, and experience gaming like never before. It's time to showcase your skills and embrace your inner dad in this one-of-a-kind simulator. Are you ready to seize the title of ultimate dad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by all the dads around the world, Dadlympics aims to pay a homage to all the dads out there with funny and physics-based gameplay. You challenge your friends to different dad activities such as; Mowing the lawn, Packing the car, Grocery shopping and more.. But be on the lookout, there's trouble-makers for dads out there who only want to scrap..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096760/extras/eba1507c903c3396f2ca4762ede6af6f.avif?t=1732038348\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Online multiplayer with up to 6 people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Character Customization and unlockables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Wacky Physics-based environments &amp; interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Varied maps with different challenges and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Realistic Dad-noises</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096760/extras/66015113efdf05c3688adb2cc0f167d2.avif?t=1732038348\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of dynamic physics-based entertainment with DADLYMPICS! Unleash laughter as you take on side-splitting dad-worthy challenges alongside friends. Who will emerge as the ultimate dad? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096760/extras/5c3f60e121abb1ee25ce5ce694a2ae37.avif?t=1732038348\" /></div>Engage in hilarious competitions, conquer quirky tasks, and experience gaming like never before. It's time to showcase your skills and embrace your inner dad in this one-of-a-kind simulator. Are you ready to seize the title of ultimate dad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by all the dads around the world, Dadlympics aims to pay a homage to all the dads out there with funny and physics-based gameplay. You challenge your friends to different dad activities such as; Mowing the lawn, Packing the car, Grocery shopping and more.. But be on the lookout, there's trouble-makers for dads out there who only want to scrap..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096760/extras/eba1507c903c3396f2ca4762ede6af6f.avif?t=1732038348\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Online multiplayer with up to 6 people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Character Customization and unlockables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Wacky Physics-based environments &amp; interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Varied maps with different challenges and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Realistic Dad-noises</p>",
    "short_description": "Compete with friends in DADLYMPICS! Where Dad jokes meet physics-based MAYHEM! Tackle HILARIOUS Challenges, battling solo or with friends. Who will fight their way to the title of ULTIMATE DAD? Did we mention beer?",
